WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.732
LeaguePour runs bar leagues and
tournaments, from signup to standings.

2
00:00:06.032 --> 00:00:07.728
Start with the free tools.

3
00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:09.151
No account needed.

4
00:00:09.304 --> 00:00:12.827
Type your team names into the double
elimination bracket generator,

5
00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:16.089
and it builds the winners
and losers brackets for you.

6
00:00:16.665 --> 00:00:18.652
Click a winner and they advance.

7
00:00:18.756 --> 00:00:21.065
The loser drops into the losers bracket.

8
00:00:21.105 --> 00:00:24.055
To run the night online,
create a venue account.

9
00:00:25.155 --> 00:00:27.062
Signing up takes four fields:

10
00:00:27.118 --> 00:00:30.246
your name, email, a password
and your venue's name.

11
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.649
No credit card.

12
00:00:32.749 --> 00:00:34.762
Next, create a competition:

13
00:00:34.885 --> 00:00:37.792
name it, pick the game and choose a format.

14
00:00:37.978 --> 00:00:42.422
Single elimination brackets and round
robin schedules are built for you.

15
00:00:43.522 --> 00:00:48.017
Set a $0 entry fee, or charge one
through Stripe once you connect it.

16
00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:49.333
Then publish.

17
00:00:50.433 --> 00:00:53.615
Your event gets a public page and a QR code.

18
00:00:53.724 --> 00:00:56.950
Players register from their
phone with a free player account.

19
00:00:57.142 --> 00:00:58.783
No app to download.

20
00:00:59.883 --> 00:01:02.584
When signup closes, press Start Tournament.

21
00:01:02.745 --> 00:01:05.786
Round one is generated
from your registrations.

22
00:01:05.915 --> 00:01:08.404
Enter each score, and winners move on.

23
00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:14.520
Players follow results on the public page,
or on a live scoreboard on the bar TV.

24
00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:19.334
Your first active competition
is free, with every feature.

25
00:01:19.489 --> 00:01:23.252
Paid plans start at $29 a
month to run more at once.

26
00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:25.378
Free events have no fees.

27
00:01:26.478 --> 00:01:28.786
Start free at leaguepour.com.

28
00:01:28.838 --> 00:01:31.116
Or try the bracket generator first.
